      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/26806c8f2d94c32d734b96562d5465bd78852b0b4985d7db32b16a29e83b087a.wav",
      "story_index": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "en",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Researchers found AI models can predict new material properties with less data.",
      "start_sec": 16.7,
      "end_sec": 23.614,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/ddb18bf02d7d935fbcc5c4e9adebd16c69ea30388136e169255c95184ae70a3d.wav",
      "story_index": 1,
      "sentence_id": "s01"
    },
    {
      "type": "zh",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "研究人員發現，人工智慧模型能以更少的資料預測新材料的特性。",
      "start_sec": 24.414,
      "end_sec": 30.825,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/64520ff0b95515f537396c59f83f6f39645c55fe93d613622e9bfc8e50d87a6f.wav",
      "story_index": 1,
      "sentence_id": "s01"
    },
    {
      "type": "en",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "They discovered that 90% of training data could be discarded without losing accuracy.",
      "start_sec": 31.425,
      "end_sec": 38.204,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/12716753e452194f45e67437a966b1ded5fe846f4f377ef969c82a6202acc4b7.wav",
