    {
      "type": "zh",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "第 3 則新聞：世界銀行報告：小型企業面臨 4 兆美元融資缺口",
      "start_sec": 296.27,
      "end_sec": 303.191,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/b702c2b4cf0e1688601c4b34cfe03d4d7f1ee313820310cf7f3ee1cb145e4be3.wav",
      "story_index": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "en",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Developing countries face a $4 trillion finance gap for small businesses.",
      "start_sec": 303.791,
      "end_sec": 310.601,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/899e5be71a51af9612e691d4f313d1e35aa427b94311544d02d735494346f3bc.wav",
      "story_index": 3,
      "sentence_id": "s01"
    },
    {
      "type": "zh",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "開發中國家的小型企業面臨 4 兆美元的融資缺口。",
      "start_sec": 311.401,
      "end_sec": 316.682,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/5a90ecf6126eed1653317624877088c734de1179c67913b26e67ab860c8629f7.wav",
      "story_index": 3,
      "sentence_id": "s01"
    },
    {
      "type": "en",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "This limits their ability to grow, trade, and create jobs effectively.",
      "start_sec": 317.282,
      "end_sec": 323.674,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/b26b52abe3eaf858aee28f3f8f9e66a05fe497d3d1b57f8cbb47090ca2aa6790.wav",
      "story_index": 3,
      "sentence_id": "s02"
    },
    {
      "type": "zh",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "這限制了它們有效成長、貿易和創造就業機會的能力。",
      "start_sec": 324.474,
      "end_sec": 329.955,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/ab34ef88b0625633dcd4cf7ab4085f61b57e917c434c794619cd93516e10203f.wav",
      "story_index": 3,
      "sentence_id": "s02"
    },
    {
      "type": "en",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Micro, small, and medium enterprises, or MSMEs, employ 75% of workers.",
      "start_sec": 330.555,
      "end_sec": 339.432,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/d750e76e7dc20929dda486f43fd41cebf0a36d89541f0f66462a20e77e3b9c11.wav",
      "story_index": 3,
      "sentence_id": "s03"
    },
    {
      "type": "zh",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "微型、小型和中型企業（MSMEs）僱用了 75% 的勞工。",
      "start_sec": 340.232,
      "end_sec": 346.953,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/8c9c19e5106f5f5e88a805fe7999ba61d9a689a6a9054ec14fab22a16b24f3d7.wav",
      "story_index": 3,
      "sentence_id": "s03"
    },
    {
      "type": "en",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Lack of digital records and regulatory burdens are key constraints.",
      "start_sec": 347.553,
      "end_sec": 353.366,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/d284fefd61ab67e4badd0d77344f11bb28cb903cc139ecbba3f8e040570c2014.wav",
      "story_index": 3,
      "sentence_id": "s04"
    },
    {
      "type": "zh",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "缺乏數位紀錄和監管負擔是主要的限制因素。",
